   (No file extension — file ka naam literally "windows-app-web-link" hai.)

   PACKAGE FAMILY NAME KAISE NIKALE:
   Package.appxmanifest mein Identity Name aur Publisher abhi CI ke
   WINDOWS_PACKAGE_IDENTITY_NAME / WINDOWS_PACKAGE_PUBLISHER variables se
   build ke time fill hote hain (Partner Center → App identity se copy
   kiye hue) — is repo mein sirf placeholder hai, isliye Package Family
   Name yahan se compute nahi ho sakta. Build hone ke baad nikaalne ke
   2 tareeke:

   1. App install karke PowerShell mein:
        Get-AppxPackage -Name "*StudyBuddyZone*" | Select PackageFamilyName
      Jo output aaye (jaise "Contoso.StudyBuddyZone_9z8a1v6z8g0v6") wahi
      __PACKAGE_FAMILY_NAME__ ki jagah daalo.

   2. Ya Partner Center → App identity page pe "Package family name" field
      seedha wahin likha hota hai.
